Search in BST:
--------------
L<N<R
Time complexity: O(logN) which is the height of the tree as we do not traverse the whole tree only one path


class Solution{
    public TreeNode searchBST(TreeNode root,int val){
        while(root!=null && root.val!=val){
            root = val<root.val ? root.left:root.right;
        }
        return root;
    }
}